    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "qRAom",
      "x": 4066.5,
      "y": 8090,
      "name": "Motion Notes — Wave Timeline",
      "width": 640,
      "fill": "#FFFFFF",
      "cornerRadius": 16,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 22,
      "padding": 40,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "G4D1ja",
          "name": "Title",
          "fill": "#111111",
          "content": "Motion Notes — 給實作時參考",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 18,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "ygN9D",
          "name": "Wave — 永遠在呼吸",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "YkepT",
              "name": "Label",
              "fill": "$a-accent",
              "content": "WAVE — 永遠在呼吸",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "700",
              "letterSpacing": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "GHEQK",
              "name": "Body",
              "fill": "#444444",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "波浪線持續、緩慢地位移（例如整條路徑隨時間做極小幅度的水平相位漂移），永不靜止、也永不誇張。振幅維持 8–16px，週期放慢，讓人感覺像水面或呼吸，而不是訊號波。",
              "lineHeight": 1.65,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "q8akv",
          "name": "Current Moment — 聚焦而非放大",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Cwua5",
              "name": "Label",
              "fill": "$a-accent",
              "content": "CURRENT MOMENT — 聚焦而非放大",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "700",
              "letterSpacing": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "UmCKj",
              "name": "Body",
              "fill": "#444444",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "今天的節點大小與其他日子相同，不放大。聚焦感來自：靠近今天的振幅逐漸增加、節點不透明度逐漸提升、以及今天位置上一圈柔光（blur glow）。是整條波浪把注意力慢慢帶到這裡，不是一個按鈕被強調。",
              "lineHeight": 1.65,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "bZOeo",
          "name": "Card — 從時間裡浮現",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "P61ZH",
              "name": "Label",
              "fill": "$a-accent",
              "content": "CARD — 從時間裡浮現",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "700",
              "letterSpacing": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "HtTdb",
              "name": "Body",
              "fill": "#444444",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "切換文章時，卡片不是彈出或滑入，而是 Fade + 8–12px 上移同時發生，600–900ms，ease-out（無 bounce/elastic）。舊卡片先淡出、微下沉，新卡片接著淡入、微上浮，像記憶慢慢浮現又沉回時間裡。",
              "lineHeight": 1.65,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "wJnzZ",
          "name": "Timeline 拖曳／滑動",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "bpwiM",
              "name": "Label",
              "fill": "$a-accent",
              "content": "TIMELINE 拖曳／滑動",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "700",
              "letterSpacing": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "pnvPF",
              "name": "Body",
              "fill": "#444444",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "水平拖曳時整條波浪跟著慣性緩緩滑動，停下來時波浪不會瞬間定住，而是像水面一樣多晃 1–2 個週期才慢慢平靜下來。",
              "lineHeight": 1.65,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "jLUQD",
          "name": "同一天 — 縱軸閱讀",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "bZ0a3",
              "name": "Label",
              "fill": "$a-accent",
              "content": "同一天 — 縱軸閱讀",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "700",
              "letterSpacing": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "gi4FY",
              "name": "Body",
              "fill": "#444444",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "橫向（← →）在不同天之間移動；同一天若有多篇，卡片上下會出現極輕的 chevron，往下滑（↓）讀下一篇、往上滑（↑）回到上一篇，Transition 與日期切換一致（fade + 8–12px 位移）。時間軸上這些天的節點會多一顆極小的伴生點，暗示「這裡不只一瞬」，但不強調、不打斷波浪本身的安靜。",
              "lineHeight": 1.65,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
